    [*] --> SUBMITTED: Citizen Submits Complaint

    SUBMITTED --> TRIAGED: Officer Reviews / Auto-Triage
    SUBMITTED --> ASSIGNED: Direct Officer Assignment

    TRIAGED --> ASSIGNED: Assign to Officer / Department
    TRIAGED --> NEEDS_INFORMATION: Request Citizen Clarification
    TRIAGED --> ESCALATED: SLA Overdue / Supervisor Action

    ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS: Officer Starts Investigation
    ASSIGNED --> NEEDS_INFORMATION: Evidence Insufficient
    ASSIGNED --> ESCALATED: SLA Breached

    IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED: Resolution Summary + Fix Applied
    IN_PROGRESS --> NEEDS_INFORMATION: Field Details Required
    IN_PROGRESS --> ESCALATED: Exceeded Max Time Limit

    NEEDS_INFORMATION --> IN_PROGRESS: Citizen Submits Response
    NEEDS_INFORMATION --> ASSIGNED: Re-queued
    NEEDS_INFORMATION --> RESOLVED: Resolved after clarifications

    ESCALATED --> IN_PROGRESS: Expedited Investigation
    ESCALATED --> RESOLVED: Senior Officer Resolution

    RESOLVED --> CLOSED: Citizen Confirms / Auto-Close SLA
    RESOLVED --> REOPENED: Citizen Dissatisfied / Appeal

    CLOSED --> REOPENED: Grievance Persists

    REOPENED --> TRIAGED: Re-Assessment by Supervisor
    REOPENED --> ASSIGNED: Assigned for Fresh Investigation
    REOPENED --> IN_PROGRESS: Immediate Redressal

    CLOSED --> [*]
